OL,3,AUS embassy accuses Canada of election
OL,4,Ameddling ahead of midterms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Embassy in Ottawa has accused
OL,7,FCanadian officials of election meddling
OL,8,Fahead of the November midterms.
OL,10,FThe embassy said Canadian leaders have
OL,11,Fbrushed off concerns over "potential
OL,12,Finterference", and that ministers and
OL,13,Fpremiers "openly describe plans to
OL,14,Finfluence American politics in official
OL,15,Fdocuments and public appearances".
OL,17,FCanadian leaders, including Prime
OL,18,FMinister Mark Carney, have dismissed
OL,19,Fthe claims. Relations between the North
OL,20,FAmerican neighbours have hardened
OL,21,Fduring second Trump administration.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
