OL,3,AUS embassy accuses Canada of election
OL,4,Ameddling ahead of midterms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe midterms will determine which
OL,7,Fpolitical party controls both branches
OL,8,Fof the US Congress, which could have a
OL,9,Fsignificant impact on the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
